  "details": "With preloading now out on the Live version, I got a feeling that it's incomplete.\n\nIt would be nice to have a preload prompt on portals. It would be a nice option to have when you're exploring worlds or doing adventure maps with a group, especially when you're with people with slow internet.\n\nThat way if there is a big world to download, you still can chat and be with your friends after starting the preload through the portal.\n\nThat'd complete the world preload features and have it more uses :D",
